        "text": "Discussions of quantum mechanics often refer to Hilbert space.\nIn the finite dimensional complex vector spaces that come up in quantum computation and quantum information, a Hilbert space is exactly the same thing as an inner product space.\nFrom now on we use the two terms interchangeably, preferring the term Hilbert space.\n"
